<P style="BOX-SIZING: border-box !important; TEXT-ALIGN: center; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; MIN-HEIGHT: 1em; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px; MAX-WIDTH: 100%; WORD-WRAP: break-word !important; CLEAR: both; PADDING-TOP: 0px"><SPAN style="BOX-SIZING: border-box !important; TEXT-ALIGN: justify; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; WIDOWS: 1; BACKGROUND-COLOR: rgb(255,255,255); MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px; FONT-FAMILY: -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Helvetica Neue', 'PingFang SC', 'Hiragino Sans GB', 'Microsoft YaHei UI', 'Microsoft YaHei', Arial, sans-serif; MAX-WIDTH: 100%; WORD-WRAP: break-word !important; LETTER-SPACING: 2px; COLOR: rgb(95,156,239); FONT-SIZE: 14px; PADDING-TOP: 0px">【人物名片】</SPAN></P>
<P style="BOX-SIZING: border-box !important; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; MIN-HEIGHT: 1em; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px; MAX-WIDTH: 100%; WORD-WRAP: break-word !important; CLEAR: both; PADDING-TOP: 0px"><SPAN style="BOX-SIZING: border-box !important; TEXT-ALIGN: justify; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; WIDOWS: 1; BACKGROUND-COLOR: rgb(255,255,255); MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px; FONT-FAMILY: -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Helvetica Neue', 'PingFang SC', 'Hiragino Sans GB', 'Microsoft YaHei UI', 'Microsoft YaHei', Arial, sans-serif; MAX-WIDTH: 100%; WORD-WRAP: break-word !important; LETTER-SPACING: 2px; COLOR: rgb(95,156,239); FONT-SIZE: 14px; PADDING-TOP: 0px"><BR style="BOX-SIZING: border-box !important; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px; MAX-WIDTH: 100%; WORD-WRAP: break-word !important; PADDING-TOP: 0px"></SPAN></P>
<P style="BOX-SIZING: border-box !important; TEXT-ALIGN: center; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; MIN-HEIGHT: 1em; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px; MAX-WIDTH: 100%; WORD-WRAP: break-word !important; CLEAR: both; PADDING-TOP: 0px"><SPAN style="BOX-SIZING: border-box !important; TEXT-ALIGN: justify; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; WIDOWS: 1; BACKGROUND-COLOR: rgb(255,255,255); MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px; FONT-FAMILY: -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Helvetica Neue', 'PingFang SC', 'Hiragino Sans GB', 'Microsoft YaHei UI', 'Microsoft YaHei', Arial, sans-serif; MAX-WIDTH: 100%; WORD-WRAP: break-word !important; LETTER-SPACING: 2px; COLOR: rgb(95,156,239); FONT-SIZE: 14px; PADDING-TOP: 0px">陈丹燕，绍兴一中物理高级教师，中共党员，1999年上海师范大学理工信息学院物理教育专业毕业后在校任教至今，现任高三年级组长、班主任兼物理教师。2016年荣获“绍兴市最美教师”称号。</SPAN></P>
<P style="BOX-SIZING: border-box !important; TEXT-ALIGN: center; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; MIN-HEIGHT: 1em; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px; MAX-WIDTH: 100%; WORD-WRAP: break-word !important; CLEAR: both; PADDING-TOP: 0px"><IMG onmousewheel="return bbimg(this)" border=0 hspace=0 alt="" src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/UploadFiles/201809/2018092809553556.jpg" onload=resizepic(this)><BR><BR></P>
<P style="BOX-SIZING: border-box !important; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; MIN-HEIGHT: 1em; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px; MAX-WIDTH: 100%; WORD-WRAP: break-word !important; CLEAR: both; PADDING-TOP: 0px"><BR style="BOX-SIZING: border-box !important; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px; MAX-WIDTH: 100%; WORD-WRAP: break-word !important; PADDING-TOP: 0px"></P>
<P style="BOX-SIZING: border-box !important; TEXT-ALIGN: center; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; MIN-HEIGHT: 1em; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px; MAX-WIDTH: 100%; WORD-WRAP: break-word !important; CLEAR: both; PADDING-TOP: 0px"><STRONG style="BOX-SIZING: border-box !important; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px; MAX-WIDTH: 100%; WORD-WRAP: break-word !important; PADDING-TOP: 0px"><SPAN style="BOX-SIZING: border-box !important; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px; MAX-WIDTH: 100%; WORD-WRAP: break-word !important; COLOR: rgb(255,0,0); PADDING-TOP: 0px">在她眼里，班上的50个孩子如同花儿一样美</SPAN></STRONG></P>
<P style="BOX-SIZING: border-box !important; TEXT-ALIGN: justify; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; LINE-HEIGHT: 25px; BACKGROUND-COLOR: rgb(255,255,255); MARGIN: 0px; MIN-HEIGHT: 1em; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px; MAX-WIDTH: 100%; WORD-WRAP: break-word !important; WHITE-SPACE: normal; CLEAR: both; PADDING-TOP: 0px"><SPAN style="BOX-SIZING: border-box !important; TEXT-ALIGN: justify; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; BACKGROUND-COLOR: rgb(255,255,255); MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px; MAX-WIDTH: 100%; WORD-WRAP: break-word !important; FONT-SIZE: 16px; PADDING-TOP: 0px"><BR style="BOX-SIZING: border-box !important; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px; MAX-WIDTH: 100%; WORD-WRAP: break-word !important; PADDING-TOP: 0px"></SPAN></P>
<P style="BOX-SIZING: border-box !important; TEXT-ALIGN: justify; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; LINE-HEIGHT: 25px; BACKGROUND-COLOR: rgb(255,255,255); MARGIN: 0px; MIN-HEIGHT: 1em; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px; MAX-WIDTH: 100%; WORD-WRAP: break-word !important; WHITE-SPACE: normal; CLEAR: both; PADDING-TOP: 0px"><SPAN style="BOX-SIZING: border-box !important; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px; MAX-WIDTH: 100%; WORD-WRAP: break-word !important; FONT-SIZE: 16px; PADDING-TOP: 0px"><SPAN style="BOX-SIZING: border-box !important; TEXT-ALIGN: justify; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; BACKGROUND-COLOR: rgb(255,255,255); MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px; MAX-WIDTH: 100%; WORD-WRAP: break-word !important; PADDING-TOP: 0px">　　</SPAN>办公桌上，玫瑰花散发着淡淡的清香，书籍、纸笔等摆放得整整齐齐。一身红色的连衣裙，一头梳得乌黑柔亮的秀发。“干净”，这是绍兴一中高三（10）班班主任陈丹燕给记者的第一印象。事实上也确实如此：1999年参加工作后的每个早晨，她都会在自己的办公桌放一朵新鲜的玫瑰花。</SPAN></P>
<P style="BOX-SIZING: border-box !important; TEXT-ALIGN: justify; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; LINE-HEIGHT: 25px; BACKGROUND-COLOR: rgb(255,255,255); MARGIN: 0px; MIN-HEIGHT: 1em; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px; MAX-WIDTH: 100%; WORD-WRAP: break-word !important; WHITE-SPACE: normal; CLEAR: both; PADDING-TOP: 0px"><SPAN style="BOX-SIZING: border-box !important; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px; MAX-WIDTH: 100%; WORD-WRAP: break-word !important; FONT-SIZE: 16px; PADDING-TOP: 0px"><BR style="BOX-SIZING: border-box !important; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px; MAX-WIDTH: 100%; WORD-WRAP: break-word !important; PADDING-TOP: 0px"></SPAN></P>
<P style="BOX-SIZING: border-box !important; TEXT-ALIGN: justify; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; LINE-HEIGHT: 25px; BACKGROUND-COLOR: rgb(255,255,255); MARGIN: 0px; MIN-HEIGHT: 1em; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px; MAX-WIDTH: 100%; WORD-WRAP: break-word !important; WHITE-SPACE: normal; CLEAR: both; PADDING-TOP: 0px"><SPAN style="BOX-SIZING: border-box !important; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px; MAX-WIDTH: 100%; WORD-WRAP: break-word !important; FONT-SIZE: 16px; PADDING-TOP: 0px">　　鲜花，给自己准备，也为学生们准备。“沉浸在书香的他们，偶尔看一看娇艳的鲜花，心情也许会更好吧，我是这么想的。”说这话时，陈丹燕笑靥如花。</SPAN></P>
<P style="BOX-SIZING: border-box !important; TEXT-ALIGN: justify; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; LINE-HEIGHT: 25px; BACKGROUND-COLOR: rgb(255,255,255); MARGIN: 0px; MIN-HEIGHT: 1em; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px; MAX-WIDTH: 100%; WORD-WRAP: break-word !important; WHITE-SPACE: normal; CLEAR: both; PADDING-TOP: 0px"><SPAN style="BOX-SIZING: border-box !important; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px; MAX-WIDTH: 100%; WORD-WRAP: break-word !important; FONT-SIZE: 16px; PADDING-TOP: 0px"><BR style="BOX-SIZING: border-box !important; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px; MAX-WIDTH: 100%; WORD-WRAP: break-word !important; PADDING-TOP: 0px"></SPAN></P>
<P style="BOX-SIZING: border-box !important; TEXT-ALIGN: justify; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; LINE-HEIGHT: 25px; BACKGROUND-COLOR: rgb(255,255,255); MARGIN: 0px; MIN-HEIGHT: 1em; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px; MAX-WIDTH: 100%; WORD-WRAP: break-word !important; WHITE-SPACE: normal; CLEAR: both; PADDING-TOP: 0px"><SPAN style="BOX-SIZING: border-box !important; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px; MAX-WIDTH: 100%; WORD-WRAP: break-word !important; FONT-SIZE: 16px; PADDING-TOP: 0px">　　在她眼里，班上的50个孩子如同花儿一样美，但也脆弱。花会谢，人也有情绪低落时。陈老师要做的就是，用爱呵护每一颗受伤的心。譬如，有个2015届的毕业生，高三那年几次模拟考都做不完试题，心理压力特别大，情绪波动也厉害。每次考完试，这位女学生都要找陈老师哭一回。“没关系，哭出来就好了”，陈老师总是这么安慰她。</SPAN></P>
<P style="BOX-SIZING: border-box !important; TEXT-ALIGN: justify; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; LINE-HEIGHT: 25px; BACKGROUND-COLOR: rgb(255,255,255); MARGIN: 0px; MIN-HEIGHT: 1em; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px; MAX-WIDTH: 100%; WORD-WRAP: break-word !important; WHITE-SPACE: normal; CLEAR: both; PADDING-TOP: 0px"><SPAN style="BOX-SIZING: border-box !important; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px; MAX-WIDTH: 100%; WORD-WRAP: break-word !important; FONT-SIZE: 16px; PADDING-TOP: 0px"><BR style="BOX-SIZING: border-box !important; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px; MAX-WIDTH: 100%; WORD-WRAP: break-word !important; PADDING-TOP: 0px"></SPAN></P>
<P style="BOX-SIZING: border-box !important; TEXT-ALIGN: justify; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; LINE-HEIGHT: 25px; BACKGROUND-COLOR: rgb(255,255,255); MARGIN: 0px; MIN-HEIGHT: 1em; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px; MAX-WIDTH: 100%; WORD-WRAP: break-word !important; WHITE-SPACE: normal; CLEAR: both; PADDING-TOP: 0px"><SPAN style="BOX-SIZING: border-box !important; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px; MAX-WIDTH: 100%; WORD-WRAP: break-word !important; FONT-SIZE: 16px; PADDING-TOP: 0px">　　女孩家和陈老师家离得不远，每次开车回家陈老师就捎上她。“一路上我就做个倾听者，让她明白老师一直都在关心她。”陈丹燕说。好几次，她邀请女孩到家，专门给她“开小灶”：讲解解题方式，改变应试方法。“考试时被某道题卡住了，她就要纠结，我告诉她‘跳过’，几次训练下来，她慢慢改掉了不好的做题习惯。”陈丹燕说，那一年高考，女孩考出了好成绩，总分比一本线高出了60分。</SPAN></P>
<P style="BOX-SIZING: border-box !important; TEXT-ALIGN: justify; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; LINE-HEIGHT: 25px; BACKGROUND-COLOR: rgb(255,255,255); MARGIN: 0px; MIN-HEIGHT: 1em; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px; MAX-WIDTH: 100%; WORD-WRAP: break-word !important; WHITE-SPACE: normal; CLEAR: both; PADDING-TOP: 0px"><SPAN style="BOX-SIZING: border-box !important; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px; MAX-WIDTH: 100%; WORD-WRAP: break-word !important; FONT-SIZE: 16px; PADDING-TOP: 0px"><BR style="BOX-SIZING: border-box !important; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px; MAX-WIDTH: 100%; WORD-WRAP: break-word !important; PADDING-TOP: 0px"></SPAN></P>
<P style="BOX-SIZING: border-box !important; TEXT-ALIGN: justify; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; LINE-HEIGHT: 25px; BACKGROUND-COLOR: rgb(255,255,255); MARGIN: 0px; MIN-HEIGHT: 1em; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px; MAX-WIDTH: 100%; WORD-WRAP: break-word !important; WHITE-SPACE: normal; CLEAR: both; PADDING-TOP: 0px"><SPAN style="BOX-SIZING: border-box !important; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px; MAX-WIDTH: 100%; WORD-WRAP: break-word !important; FONT-SIZE: 16px; PADDING-TOP: 0px">　　再比如，有一个男生性格较“耿直”，动不动就和同学闹别扭。有一次，他踢完足球，气呼呼地回到教室，脸上带着伤。原来他抢球时与别人发生了不愉快。陈丹燕把他叫到办公室，好一番开导。在与男生及家长沟通后，陈老师发现该男生冲动的性格与缺少家庭关爱有关。这份关爱由陈老师来弥补。“他生日到了，我会在他抽屉里放一份小礼物；发脾气后，我会递个小字条给他，上面写些鼓励的话。”陈丹燕说。慢慢地，这名男生变得沉静了，讲话也不那么“冲”了，更难得的是，他爱上了学习，“可以整个上午坐在书桌前。”陈老师说，这名男生后来顺利考入了警校。</SPAN></P>
<P style="BOX-SIZING: border-box !important; TEXT-ALIGN: justify; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; LINE-HEIGHT: 25px; BACKGROUND-COLOR: rgb(255,255,255); MARGIN: 0px; MIN-HEIGHT: 1em; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px; MAX-WIDTH: 100%; WORD-WRAP: break-word !important; WHITE-SPACE: normal; CLEAR: both; PADDING-TOP: 0px"><SPAN style="BOX-SIZING: border-box !important; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px; MAX-WIDTH: 100%; WORD-WRAP: break-word !important; FONT-SIZE: 16px; PADDING-TOP: 0px"><BR style="BOX-SIZING: border-box !important; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px; MAX-WIDTH: 100%; WORD-WRAP: break-word !important; PADDING-TOP: 0px"></SPAN></P>
<P style="BOX-SIZING: border-box !important; TEXT-ALIGN: justify; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; LINE-HEIGHT: 25px; BACKGROUND-COLOR: rgb(255,255,255); MARGIN: 0px; MIN-HEIGHT: 1em; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px; MAX-WIDTH: 100%; WORD-WRAP: break-word !important; WHITE-SPACE: normal; CLEAR: both; PADDING-TOP: 0px"><SPAN style="BOX-SIZING: border-box !important; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px; MAX-WIDTH: 100%; WORD-WRAP: break-word !important; FONT-SIZE: 16px; PADDING-TOP: 0px">　　今年3月，陈丹燕收到了一份惊喜，全班同学瞒着她订了生日蛋糕。“陈老师，生日快乐。您是我们的源动力。”蛋糕上写着这样一句祝福。</SPAN></P>
<P style="BOX-SIZING: border-box !important; TEXT-ALIGN: justify; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; LINE-HEIGHT: 25px; BACKGROUND-COLOR: rgb(255,255,255); MARGIN: 0px; MIN-HEIGHT: 1em; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px; MAX-WIDTH: 100%; WORD-WRAP: break-word !important; WHITE-SPACE: normal; CLEAR: both; PADDING-TOP: 0px"><BR style="BOX-SIZING: border-box !important; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px; MAX-WIDTH: 100%; WORD-WRAP: break-word !important; PADDING-TOP: 0px"></P>
<P style="BOX-SIZING: border-box !important; TEXT-ALIGN: center; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; MIN-HEIGHT: 1em; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px; MAX-WIDTH: 100%; WORD-WRAP: break-word !important; CLEAR: both; PADDING-TOP: 0px"><SPAN style="BOX-SIZING: border-box !important; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px; MAX-WIDTH: 100%; WORD-WRAP: break-word !important; COLOR: rgb(255,0,0); PADDING-TOP: 0px"><STRONG style="BOX-SIZING: border-box !important; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px; MAX-WIDTH: 100%; WORD-WRAP: break-word !important; PADDING-TOP: 0px">在她的课堂上，学生们总是面带微笑</STRONG></SPAN></P>
<P style="BOX-SIZING: border-box !important; TEXT-ALIGN: justify; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; LINE-HEIGHT: 25px; BACKGROUND-COLOR: rgb(255,255,255); MARGIN: 0px; MIN-HEIGHT: 1em; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px; MAX-WIDTH: 100%; WORD-WRAP: break-word !important; WHITE-SPACE: normal; CLEAR: both; PADDING-TOP: 0px"><BR style="BOX-SIZING: border-box !important; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px; MAX-WIDTH: 100%; WORD-WRAP: break-word !important; PADDING-TOP: 0px"></P>
<P style="BOX-SIZING: border-box !important; TEXT-ALIGN: justify; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; LINE-HEIGHT: 25px; BACKGROUND-COLOR: rgb(255,255,255); MARGIN: 0px; MIN-HEIGHT: 1em; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px; MAX-WIDTH: 100%; WORD-WRAP: break-word !important; WHITE-SPACE: normal; CLEAR: both; PADDING-TOP: 0px">　　同学们看到的陈丹燕总是面带微笑。即使在课堂上，这样的笑容也经常可见。“轻松，是我上物理课的一个原则，19年来不曾改变。”陈丹燕说，在课堂上，她尽可能不提问，好处是把更多的知识点灌输给学生，但整堂课听下来，学生很难全程集中注意力。“我会适时讲一两个笑话，或者穿插一点小幽默，孩子们听笑了就言归正传。”</P>
<P style="BOX-SIZING: border-box !important; TEXT-ALIGN: justify; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; LINE-HEIGHT: 25px; BACKGROUND-COLOR: rgb(255,255,255); MARGIN: 0px; MIN-HEIGHT: 1em; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px; MAX-WIDTH: 100%; WORD-WRAP: break-word !important; WHITE-SPACE: normal; CLEAR: both; PADDING-TOP: 0px"><BR style="BOX-SIZING: border-box !important; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px; MAX-WIDTH: 100%; WORD-WRAP: break-word !important; PADDING-TOP: 0px"></P>
<P style="BOX-SIZING: border-box !important; TEXT-ALIGN: justify; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; LINE-HEIGHT: 25px; BACKGROUND-COLOR: rgb(255,255,255); MARGIN: 0px; MIN-HEIGHT: 1em; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px; MAX-WIDTH: 100%; WORD-WRAP: break-word !important; WHITE-SPACE: normal; CLEAR: both; PADDING-TOP: 0px">　　多年的教学积累和实践，让陈丹燕拥有很多光环：绍兴一中物理高级教师、绍兴市最美教师等等。这些，她并未放心上。“教无定法，学无止境。”她说，教书育人，教书先育人。10多年的班主任经历，让陈丹燕自有一套育人方法。</P>
<P style="BOX-SIZING: border-box !important; TEXT-ALIGN: justify; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; LINE-HEIGHT: 25px; BACKGROUND-COLOR: rgb(255,255,255); MARGIN: 0px; MIN-HEIGHT: 1em; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px; MAX-WIDTH: 100%; WORD-WRAP: break-word !important; WHITE-SPACE: normal; CLEAR: both; PADDING-TOP: 0px"><BR style="BOX-SIZING: border-box !important; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px; MAX-WIDTH: 100%; WORD-WRAP: break-word !important; PADDING-TOP: 0px"></P>
<P style="BOX-SIZING: border-box !important; TEXT-ALIGN: justify; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; LINE-HEIGHT: 25px; BACKGROUND-COLOR: rgb(255,255,255); MARGIN: 0px; MIN-HEIGHT: 1em; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px; MAX-WIDTH: 100%; WORD-WRAP: break-word !important; WHITE-SPACE: normal; CLEAR: both; PADDING-TOP: 0px">　　在她现在带的班级里，很多学生是从“信息班”回归的。因长期与电脑为伍，一些学生与人相处时不太懂得表达。“差不多两年里，他们每天人机交流10多个小时，很少与外界接触。回归教室后讲话直来直去，给人很‘冲’的感觉。我理解他们，本意并不想这样，只是不知道怎么表达。”陈丹燕说。这时，小字条发挥了作用。“我会在小字条上写鼓励的话，同时委婉地指出问题，这种交流方式孩子们感觉很舒服。”她说。</P>
<P style="BOX-SIZING: border-box !important; TEXT-ALIGN: justify; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; LINE-HEIGHT: 25px; BACKGROUND-COLOR: rgb(255,255,255); MARGIN: 0px; MIN-HEIGHT: 1em; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px; MAX-WIDTH: 100%; WORD-WRAP: break-word !important; WHITE-SPACE: normal; CLEAR: both; PADDING-TOP: 0px"><BR style="BOX-SIZING: border-box !important; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px; MAX-WIDTH: 100%; WORD-WRAP: break-word !important; PADDING-TOP: 0px"></P>
<P style="BOX-SIZING: border-box !important; TEXT-ALIGN: justify; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; LINE-HEIGHT: 25px; BACKGROUND-COLOR: rgb(255,255,255); MARGIN: 0px; MIN-HEIGHT: 1em; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px; MAX-WIDTH: 100%; WORD-WRAP: break-word !important; WHITE-SPACE: normal; CLEAR: both; PADDING-TOP: 0px">　　有一个“信奥生”，心仪北京大学，遗憾的是，在机房里待了两年，结果没被北大“预录取”。其他同学都回归课堂了，他却向父母提出要求——再待半年机房。父母担心儿子太苦，让他放弃，一来二去矛盾产生了。“我看这孩子决心挺大，就帮着做父母的工作，家长最终答应再给孩子一次机会。”陈丹燕说，半年后，这名男生果然被北大“预录取”了。前几天，正读高三的他突然生病，请假回家休养一段时间。“家长特别紧张，怕儿子又接触电脑误了学业，问我要不要把电脑收起来，我说‘要相信孩子’。”陈丹燕说。果然，男生回到家自己就把电脑收起来了。</P>
<P style="BOX-SIZING: border-box !important; TEXT-ALIGN: justify; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; LINE-HEIGHT: 25px; BACKGROUND-COLOR: rgb(255,255,255); MARGIN: 0px; MIN-HEIGHT: 1em; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px; MAX-WIDTH: 100%; WORD-WRAP: break-word !important; WHITE-SPACE: normal; CLEAR: both; PADDING-TOP: 0px"><BR style="BOX-SIZING: border-box !important; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px; MAX-WIDTH: 100%; WORD-WRAP: break-word !important; PADDING-TOP: 0px"></P>
<P style="BOX-SIZING: border-box !important; TEXT-ALIGN: justify; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; LINE-HEIGHT: 25px; BACKGROUND-COLOR: rgb(255,255,255); MARGIN: 0px; MIN-HEIGHT: 1em; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px; MAX-WIDTH: 100%; WORD-WRAP: break-word !important; WHITE-SPACE: normal; CLEAR: both; PADDING-TOP: 0px">　　每天的前两节晚自习，陈丹燕要求学生在教室自学，第三节晚自习欢迎他们“串门”，“来我办公室，不为学习，单纯聊聊天，听听歌。”她说，同学们来了就“赖”着不肯走了，“孩子们愿意亲近，这其实也是一种凝聚力的体现。”她说。</P>
<P style="BOX-SIZING: border-box !important; TEXT-ALIGN: justify; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; LINE-HEIGHT: 25px; BACKGROUND-COLOR: rgb(255,255,255); MARGIN: 0px; MIN-HEIGHT: 1em; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px; MAX-WIDTH: 100%; WORD-WRAP: break-word !important; WHITE-SPACE: normal; CLEAR: both; PADDING-TOP: 0px"><BR style="BOX-SIZING: border-box !important; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px; MAX-WIDTH: 100%; WORD-WRAP: break-word !important; PADDING-TOP: 0px"></P>
<P style="BOX-SIZING: border-box !important; TEXT-ALIGN: justify; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; LINE-HEIGHT: 25px; BACKGROUND-COLOR: rgb(255,255,255); MARGIN: 0px; MIN-HEIGHT: 1em; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px; MAX-WIDTH: 100%; WORD-WRAP: break-word !important; WHITE-SPACE: normal; CLEAR: both; PADDING-TOP: 0px">　　“老师这个职业，我这辈子是认定了，简单又干净，这正是我想要的生活。”陈丹燕说。记者了解到，在前不久学校组织的满意度调查中，对于陈老师的班主任工作表现和教学能力，学生们都给了满分。</P>
<P style="BOX-SIZING: border-box !important; TEXT-ALIGN: justify; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; LINE-HEIGHT: 25px; BACKGROUND-COLOR: rgb(255,255,255); MARGIN: 0px; MIN-HEIGHT: 1em; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px; MAX-WIDTH: 100%; WORD-WRAP: break-word !important; WHITE-SPACE: normal; CLEAR: both; PADDING-TOP: 0px"> </P>
<P style="BOX-SIZING: border-box !important; TEXT-ALIGN: justify; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; LINE-HEIGHT: 25px; BACKGROUND-COLOR: rgb(255,255,255); MARGIN: 0px; MIN-HEIGHT: 1em; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px; MAX-WIDTH: 100%; WORD-WRAP: break-word !important; WHITE-SPACE: normal; CLEAR: both; PADDING-TOP: 0px"><A href="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MjM5NzI2ODY4NA==&amp;mid=2651861218&amp;idx=2&amp;sn=df000fb52a615617506dbe0f477cb6c9&amp;chksm=bd380d418a4f8457d38e0ef7266bb27d1d77478624de6d8cd38bf9c4055f4a1c823c0a3e3153&amp;mpshare=1&amp;scene=23&amp;srcid=09217mUUSR76jDvoa4G1NGIy#rd">https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MjM5NzI2ODY4NA==&amp;mid=2651861218&amp;idx=2&amp;sn=df000fb52a615617506dbe0f477cb6c9&amp;chksm=bd380d418a4f8457d38e0ef7266bb27d1d77478624de6d8cd38bf9c4055f4a1c823c0a3e3153&amp;mpshare=1&amp;scene=23&amp;srcid=09217mUUSR76jDvoa4G1NGIy#rd</A></P>
<P style="BOX-SIZING: border-box !important; TEXT-ALIGN: justify; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; LINE-HEIGHT: 25px; BACKGROUND-COLOR: rgb(255,255,255); MARGIN: 0px; MIN-HEIGHT: 1em; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px; MAX-WIDTH: 100%; WORD-WRAP: break-word !important; WHITE-SPACE: normal; CLEAR: both; PADDING-TOP: 0px"> </P>
<P style="TEXT-ALIGN: left; LINE-HEIGHT: 170%; TEXT-INDENT: 121.5pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; WORD-BREAK: break-all; mso-char-indent-count: 9.0; mso-pagination: widow-orphan" class=MsoNormal align=left><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 170%; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 13.5pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Courier New'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Courier New'; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt">（摘自绍兴晚报</SPAN><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 170%; FONT-FAMILY: 'Courier New'; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 13.5pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-bidi" lang=EN-US><SPAN style="mso-spacerun: yes">  </SPAN>2018</SPAN><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 170%; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 13.5pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Courier New'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Courier New'; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt">年</SPAN><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 170%; FONT-FAMILY: 'Courier New'; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 13.5pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-bidi" lang=EN-US>9</SPAN><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 170%; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 13.5pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Courier New'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Courier New'; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt">月6</SPAN><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 170%; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 13.5pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Courier New'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Courier New'; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt">日</SPAN><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 170%; FONT-FAMILY: 'Courier New'; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 13.5pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: